cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "plant-ppi-screening: a harness for structural screening of plant protein-protein interactions"
abstract: >-
  Converts a curated list of candidate plant protein pairs into AlphaFold Server
  batch jobs within the free daily quota and token limit, parses the returned
  interface confidence metrics, and scores the resulting ranking against known
  positives and explicit negatives. Includes an integrity guard that refuses to
  report metrics while any label remains unverified.
